      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a brief for a new C-suite search for a global tech client. We're looking to define the specific \"executive presence\" and personality traits we should be scouting for. Can you give me a breakdown of what constitutes \"commanding authority\" and high-level leadership presence in a modern corporate setting?",
